gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Well, isn't this astonishing?\p"
	.string "A kid, from a secluded village,\n"
	.string "who climbed every step of the\l"
	.string "unforgiving Thura's Council Challenge?\p"
	.string "Your grandma must be so proud of you.\p"
	.string "And to achieve that with all but\n"
	.string "a sole companion...\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "Fascinating.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "This is your companion, by the\n"
	.string "way. Xatu. But, more on it later.\p"
	.string "First, I need to gather some info\n"
	.string "on your very person.\p"
	.string "After all, you're someone that is\n"
	.string "very special...\p"
	.string "I need to make you the way you\n"
	.string "truly are.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "...$"

gText_Birch_Haircut::
	.string "What is your haircut?$"

gText_Birch_DifficultyLevel::
	.string "What is your style of play?$"

gText_Birch_DifficultyCasual::
	.string "A casual style of play means\n"
	.string "that you'll have access to an\l"
	.string "Infinite Candy early on,\l"
	.string "and maxed-out IVs.\p"
	.string "Although, there'll be level\n"
	.string "caps, to keep your run a bit\l"
	.string "challenging.\p"
	.string "Are you content with that\n"
	.string "choice?\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_DifficultyNormal::
	.string "A normal style of play means\n"
	.string "that you'll play the game as it\l"
	.string "was originally designed:\l"
	.string "no Inifinte Candy, some grinding,\l"
	.string "and no level caps.\p"
	.string "Are you content with that\n"
	.string "choice?\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_DifficultyHard::
	.string "In a Nuzlocke, you can only\n"
	.string "catch one Pokémon per area,\l"
	.string "and fainted Pokémon can't\l"
	.string "be revived.\p"
	.string "You'll still have access to\n"
	.string "the Exp. Share, though.\p"
	.string "Are you content with that\n"
	.string "choice?\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "What is your skin complexion?$"

gText_Birch_SkinComplexion::
	.string "What is your skin complexion?$"

gText_Birch_FavouriteType::
	.string "What is your favourite Pokémon type,\n"
	.string "between these three types?\p"
	.string "Aside from Psychic, obviously.$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "Very well, then.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So, it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Perfect.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}, I hope you're ready.\n"
	.string "In just a few seconds, you'll face\l"
	.string "the mightiest Pokémon trainer in all\l"
	.string "Thura: the President.\p"
	.string "Brace yourself!$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "In just a few seconds, you'll face\n"
	.string "the mightiest Pokémon trainer in all\l"
	.string "Thura: the President.\p"
